# thrash_peak_window_secs must be load-bearing, not decoration. This project has
# shipped a config value that silently did nothing before (a tolerance configurable
# in PressureConfig and hardcoded in Series), so every new knob gets this pin.
file: rust/banshee-core/src/pressure/mod.rs
test: the_thrash_peak_window_is_load_bearing
---OLD---
            windowed_peak(&rates, config.thrash_peak_window_secs)
---NEW---
            windowed_peak(&rates, 300)
